{
 "id": "7d8c155c-cf37-4c96-a906-d957f080576f",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Appli de Deatta Kimi to Suisou ni Shizumu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "アプリで出会った君と水槽に沈む"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Apuri de Deatta Kimi to Suisou ni Shizumu"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Met You On An App And Now I’m Sinking Into An Aquarium"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sometimes this world feels as suffocating as drowning in water. Even when the lights are on, I feel like I'm in the dark. I want to be illuminated. I want to connect. To be honest, I hook up with people all the time, but no one ever really finds me. With a dating app, you might become connected to someone by a thread of fate. Even if it's not right. Even if it is a distorted desire. Even if there are people out there who get pleasure from hurting themselves and others. Happiness is the number of matches, and so is hell. You and I can sink and drown together. This story is about various people who match up on “dating apps”.",
   "ja": "時々、この世界は水底のように息苦しくなる。灯がついていても闇の中にいるような気分になる。照らしてほしい。繋がりたい。現実ではたくさんの異性と出会うけど、誰も自分を見つけてはくれない。でも、マッチングアプリなら誰かと運命の糸で繋がれるかもしれない。それがたとえ真っ当じゃなくとも。歪みきった欲望であっても。自分や他人を傷つけて快楽を得る人間がいたとしても。マッチングアプリの数だけ幸せが生まれ。地獄が生まれ。そして、君と二人で水槽に沈んでいく。"
  },
